===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something dropped; a [[droplet]]. {{defdate|14th C.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1821|author=Henry Hunt|title=A peep into a prison|page=193
|passage=The information we received was, that as the roof has no gutters, the '''droppings''' of water from the roof are driven by the wind against the wall.}}
# {{lb|en|usually|in the plural}} A piece of [[animal]] [[excrement]]; [[dung]]. {{defdate|late 16th C.}}
#: ''a rabbit '''dropping'''''
# The act of something that drops or falls.
#* {{Q|en|Dickens|The Pickwick Papers|36|quote=At length, after several '''droppings''' asleep, {{...}} Mr. Dowler made up his mind that he would throw himself on the bed {{...}}}}

